{"title":"Talon Head","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 35) · Monster drop: Ogre Butcher, Moonfane Moth</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 35 <span class=\"muted\">(1373 XP)</span> from 4× <a href=\"#/item/gold-bar\">Gold Bar</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/harpy-talon\">Harpy Talon</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moonfane-moth\" title=\"Moonfane Moth - dropped it in 1 of 303 looted corpses (1/303)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/ac436496b9298e59bc40.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonfane Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/303<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 1,258 looted corpses (1/1,258)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,258<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"talon-head\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/264420239c726a73de34.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/harpy-talon\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/cf4d2e12bc404da2b413.svg\" alt=\"\">Harpy Talon</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/33926a2e75ae7e63c68a.svg\" alt=\"Talon Head\"></div><h3>Talon Head</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 35</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/29/2026, 8:31:21 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}